        "original_id": "9216efe6-bd82-5e28-8d7d-6896d30c86ee",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Philip A. Cortez, Julián Castro, Rick Galindo, Barack Obama\n- Roles: Texas House of Representatives member, United States Secretary of Housing and Urban Development, San Antonio mayor\n- Organizations: Texas House of Representatives\n- Events: 2009 San Antonio mayoral election, 2014 general election\n\nFacts:\n- Julián Castro was born on September 16, 1974.\n- Philip A. Cortez was born on July 7, 1978.\n- Julián Castro won the 2009 San Antonio mayoral election and took office on June 1, 2009.\n- Rick Galindo narrowly unseated incumbent Democrat Philip A. Cortez in the November 4, 2014 general election.\n- Julián Castro served as the 16th United States Secretary of Housing and Urban Development under President Barack Obama from 2014 to 2017.\n- Philip A. Cortez is a Democratic member of the Texas House of Representatives.",
